    "chunk_text": "applicability and that the police will misuse it; they will always misuse it. That has been the history of this terrible law. And, even if your Government wishes to be otherwise, the law is applied by the police and they continue to misuse it and that is my point. So, you cannot have a policy saying that you want to be ethical and then backtrack from your previous position. Actually, that empowers a police which wants to be in transition. That is the point I am trying to make. The PTA is now being applied to teachers in schools! Yesterday, the TID had gone and questioned the teachers in Konavil Maha Vidyalayam in Kilinochchi. The TID in Paranthan had gone and questioned them because at a function, at a sports meet, there were certain artistic interpretations that the teachers had done and they have been questioned by the TID under the PTA. So, surely, there must be something done for this.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0dcf\u0db7\u0dcf\u0db4\u0dad\u0dd2\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dba (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b95\u0bc1\u0bb4\u0bc1\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bcd \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd \u0ba4\u0bb5\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bbe\u0bb3\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Chairperson of Committees) \u0ddc\u0d9a \u0d85\u0dc0\u0d82\u0dca, \u0db8\u0db1\u0dca \u0dab\u0dca\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0dab\u0db1\u0dd2.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0da2\u0dd3.\u0da2\u0dd3. \u0dc0\u0db4\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbd\u0db8\u0dca \u0dd9\u0dad\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9c\u0bc0.\u0b9c\u0bc0. \u0ba4\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba9\u0bcd\u0ba9\u0bae\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bb2\u0bae\u0bcd) (The Hon. G.G. Ponnambalam) Please give me more time, Madam.\n\nI will conclude by just saying this. The Hon. Prime Minister is now the Hon. Minister of Education, Higher Education and Vocational Education. When she was seated in the Opposition - actually she sat just behind me - she raised an issue with regard to the Jaffna Central College. In the Jaffna Central College, there was a new lady principal who was appointed and she was fully qualified. She was from the Sri Lanka Principals\u2019 Service. But, because of political interference by Douglas\n\n963 964\n\n[\u0db8\u0db1\u0dca \u0da2\u0dd3.\u0da2\u0dd3. \u0dc1\u0db4\u0ddc\u0dca \u0db1\u0db6\u0d9a\u0db1 \u0dab\u0dc4\u0dad\u0ddc]\n\n2025 \u0da2\u0dca\u200d \u0dc0\u0ddc\u0dd2\u0db4 22"
