    "chunk_text": "This whole story is carried in today\u2019s \u201cUdayan\u201d newspaper. In the letter, they had claimed and insisted that that entire land of six acres, which is actually a privately deed land or privately-owned land, cannot be taken back and handed over to the people, that from King Devanampiyathissa's time, that land has belonged to the Thissa Viharaya and that, in fact, there should be, in total, 14 acres. So, an additional several acres have to be confiscated and given for the purposes of this viharaya. Madam, this is exactly what I meant by the military being a racist institution and that it has not changed its mindset. Even if we are to assume that there is some truth to these claims, there is a legal process by which you must go.\n\nJust because you are the military, you cannot decide that you can breach any law; the days of the law of the jungle is over. But, still, they are operating on that basis.\n\n1537 1538\n\n\u0dad\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0da9\u0dd3.\u0dc0\u0dd3. \u0da0\u0dcf\u0db1\u0d9a \u0db8\u0dc0\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 * \u0db4\u0dd4\u0dca\u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0db4\u0dda \u0dad\u0dca\u0db6\u0dcf \u0d87\u0dad\u0dca. * \u0ba8\u0bc2\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0bae\u0bb2\u0baf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0bae\u0bb5\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0bc6\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1. * Placed in the Library.\n\n2025 \u0dc1\u0db4\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dd2 26\n\nit. When they could have easily built it on that land, which is rightfully owned by the viharaya, their choosing to confiscate privately owned land for this illegal act is something that cannot be allowed."
